c At-most-1 constraint on 5 variables combined with at-least-2
c Known UNSAT - requires 0 or 1 true, but also requires >= 2 true
p cnf 5 15
c At-least-2: every 4-subset must have at least one true
c (equivalently: at least 2 of 5 are true)
1 2 3 4 0
1 2 3 5 0
1 2 4 5 0
1 3 4 5 0
2 3 4 5 0
c At-most-1: no two can be simultaneously true (all C(5,2)=10 pairs)
-1 -2 0
-1 -3 0
-1 -4 0
-1 -5 0
-2 -3 0
-2 -4 0
-2 -5 0
-3 -4 0
-3 -5 0
-4 -5 0
